Subject: [PATCH] Landing showcase polish: strip filler copy, fix dashboard
 visual, add broker comparison

- Hero: removed the Property Intelligence / Watchdog pills and the
  right-hand lede paragraph
- Featured workspace tools: removed the Inside Watchdog pill and subtext
- One connected workspace: removed the pill and subtext
- Unified dashboard bento card: replaced the repeating-gradient graphic
  (which rendered as three disconnected diagonal strokes) with a real
  SVG assessed-value trend line, area fill, endpoint dot and a
  labelled axis legend
- Marketing Studio heading forced to white on the dark bento card
- New comparison section: Watchdog vs most data brokers, 11 rows,
  closing with a link to /property/compare
